{
  "category": "Windveiled Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Like the wind, it can slip through any gap, no matter how small. It leaves balls of white fluff behind.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "Riding whirlwinds, they appear. These Pokémon sneak through gaps into houses and cause all sorts of mischief.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "Like the wind, it can slip through any gap, no matter how small. It leaves balls of white fluff behind.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Like the wind, it can slip through any gap, no matter how small. It leaves balls of white fluff behind.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It rides on the wind and slips into people’s homes. After it has turned a room into a cotton- filled mess, it giggles to itself and takes off.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon appears, riding upon the wind. But if the wind gusts up, it’ll blow the cotton on this Pokémon’s head clean off.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "This nuisance sneaks into people’s homes, where it hides important things and scatters cotton all over the place.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whimsicott doesn’t live in a fixed location. It floats around on whirling winds, appearing all over the place to perform its mischief.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It scatters cotton all over the place as a prank. If it gets wet, it’ll become too heavy to move and have no choice but to answer for its mischief.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "As long as this Pokémon bathes in sunlight, its cotton keeps growing. If too much cotton fluff builds up, Whimsicott tears it off and scatters it.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
